次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":40,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012429973583282853,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af682daf4429d1fd72f8468","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794540250217,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:24:10","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af682d4f4429d1fd72f8465","chatId":"1face00a5f1b4ceaa6561db568a94111","sessionId":null,"userId":99910,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"怕自己忍不住，这份怕本身就很真实，不用假装它不在。那我们把目标定小一点：今晚少点一个赞之后，先撑三分钟不碰手机，行不行？三分钟里你想让手做点什么，好让那会儿不那么难熬？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"怕自己忍不住，这份怕本身就很真实，不用假装它不在。那我们把目标定小一点：今晚少点一个赞之后，先撑三分钟不碰手机，行不行？三分钟里你想让手做点什么，好让那会儿不那么难熬？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2172,"promptTokens":3507,"completionTokens":124,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:24:04"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":39,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.11918286934971667,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af682d4f4429d1fd72f8464","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794540244395,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:24:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af682d4f4429d1fd72f8464","chatId":"1face00a5f1b4ceaa6561db568a94111","sessionId":null,"userId":99910,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……我没想过这个。可能就深呼吸几下？或者跟自己说，空一会儿也没事。其实我有点怕那会儿会忍不住又拿起来。<第19轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":38,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.11918286934971667,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":1,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":1,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af682d4f4429d1fd72f8465","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794540244392,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:24:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af682cff4429d1fd72f8463","chatId":"1face00a5f1b4ceaa6561db568a94111","sessionId":null,"userId":99910,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"少点一个赞——这个尝试挑得挺巧，小到不会失败，又刚好是你在跟那个“还不够”的声音商量。我好奇的是，少点之后那一小段空，你打算怎么陪自己过去？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"少点一个赞——这个尝试挑得挺巧，小到不会失败，又刚好是你在跟那个“还不够”的声音商量。我好奇的是，少点之后那一小段空，你打算怎么陪自己过去？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2416,"promptTokens":3394,"completionTokens":155,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"crea